{% comment %}
  SAMAY PARFUMES - SHARED ATELIER STORY SNIPPET
  Used on dedicated About page and atelier story sections.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="samay-about-grid">
  <div class="samay-about-text">
    <div class="samay-sec-eyebrow">THE MAISON</div>
    <h2 class="serif-font" style="margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem); line-height: 1.25;">
      The Story of <em>Samay Parfumes</em>
    </h2>
    <p>
      In Sanskrit and Hindi, <strong>Samay</strong> means <em>Time</em>. Our perfumery was born from a singular obsession: creating fragrances that refuse to be forgotten. While fashion changes every season, memories ignited by scent echo forever.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every bottle of Zayro is meticulously crafted in small batches in India, marrying traditional distillation of fragrant resins and agarwood with time-honored artisanal techniques. We do not mass produce; each flacon is macerated in dark temperature-controlled cellars for over 60 days to ensure a rich, intoxicating trail.
    </p>
    <p>
      From the sun-ripened Italian bergamot at the top, to crisp lavender and royal cardamom at the heart, down to the sacred midnight oud and golden amber resin at the base, every drop is blended to perfection.
    </p>

    <div class="samay-about-stats" style="margin-top: 32px;">
      <div class="samay-stat-item">
        <strong>15-20%</strong>
        <span>Perfume Oil</span>
      </div>
      <div class="samay-stat-item">
        <strong>60+</strong>
        <span>Days Maceration</span>
      </div>
      <div class="samay-stat-item">
        <strong>50ml</strong>
        <span>Eau de Parfum</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="samay-about-media">
    <img 
      src="{{ 'samay-story-atelier.webp' | asset_url }}" 
      alt="Samay Parfumes small-batch perfume workshop"
      loading="lazy"
      width="896"
      height="1200"
      class="samay-about-img"
    >
  </div>
</div>
